@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Capa de Presentación (UI - React)" as UI {
    [LoginModal.jsx] as LoginModal
    [App.jsx] as App
    [UserProfileModal.jsx] as ProfileModal
    [translations.js] as i18n
}

package "Capa de Aplicación (FastAPI)" as App {
    [auth_routes.py] as AuthRoutes
    [LoginRequest / LoginResponse DTOs] as DTOs
    [JWT Service (_sign_token)] as JWT
    [require_auth / require_admin / require_staff] as Guards
}

package "Capa de Dominio (Conceptual)" as Domain {
    [Usuario (conceptual)] as Usuario
    [Sesion (conceptual)] as Sesion
    [Rol (enumeration)] as Rol
}

package "Capa de Infraestructura" as Infra {
    [PostgrestClient] as PgClient
    [PostgreSQL + PostgREST] as PG
    [pgcrypto (bcrypt)] as Crypto
    [JWT_SECRET_KEY (env)] as Secret
}

LoginModal --> AuthRoutes : POST /auth/login
App --> LoginModal : abre modal
App --> ProfileModal : abre perfil
LoginModal --> i18n : traduce etiquetas
LoginModal --> DTOs : construye LoginRequest
AuthRoutes --> DTOs : valida
AuthRoutes --> JWT : firma token
AuthRoutes --> Guards : verifica roles
AuthRoutes --> PgClient : rpc() / get()
AuthRoutes --> Secret : lee clave
PgClient --> PG : HTTP REST
PG --> Crypto : crypt()
PG ..> Usuario : retorna cuenta
AuthRoutes ..> Sesion : crea
AuthRoutes ..> Rol : asigna

note right of AuthRoutes
  **Endpoints expuestos:**
  - POST /api/v1/auth/login
  - POST /api/v1/auth/signup
  - GET  /api/v1/auth/usuarios
  - PUT  /api/v1/auth/usuarios/{id}
  - POST /api/v1/auth/impersonate/{id}
end note

note bottom of PG
  **RPCs utilizados:**
  - authenticate(email, password)
  - get_user_profile(user_id)
end note

@enduml